        "content": "n,text,sop,label_state\n1,schedule a meeting with Ana tomorrow,\"@c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"\"schedule\"\" modifier=\"\"tomorrow\"\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"a\"\" head=\"\"meeting\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"\"with\"\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"\"Ana\"\"\",agreement\n2,push the budget sync back by an hour,\"@c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"\"push\"\" modifier=\"\"back\"\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"the\"\" dependent=\"\"budget\"\" head=\"\"sync\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"\"by\"\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"an\"\" head=\"\"hour\"\"\",agreement\n3,when is my dentist appointment?,\"@c1 syntax.clause form=interrogative modifier=\"\"when\"\" verb=\"\"is\"\" subject=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"my\"\" dependent=\"\"dentist\"\" head=\"\"appointment\"\"\",agreement\n4,what's on my calendar tomorrow?,\"@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"\"what\"\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=interrogative verb=\"\"'s\"\" modifier=\"\"tomorrow\"\" subject=$n1\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"\"on\"\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"my\"\" head=\"\"calendar\"\"\",agreement\n5,do I have anything with Lee this week?,\"@c1 syntax.clause form=interrogative auxiliary=\"\"do\"\" verb=\"\"have\"\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2 complement=$n4\n@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"\"I\"\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"\"anything\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"\"with\"\" from=$n2 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"\"Lee\"\"\n@n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"this\"\" head=\"\"week\"\"\",agreement\n6,I'd like a separate calendar for Side project,\"@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"\"I\"\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"\"'d\"\" verb=\"\"like\"\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"a\"\" dependent=\"\"separate\"\" head=\"\"calendar\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"\"for\"\" from=$n2 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"Side\"\" head=\"\"project\"\"\",agreement\n7,can you set up a calendar named Kids school?,\"@c1 syntax.clause form=interrogative auxiliary=\"\"can\"\" verb=\"\"set\"\" modifier=\"\"up\"\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"\"you\"\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"a\"\" head=\"\"calendar\"\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"\"named\"\" complement=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"Kids\"\" head=\"\"school\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation from=$n2 to=$c2\",agreement\n10,new calendar: Freelance,\"@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"new\"\" head=\"\"calendar\"\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"\"Freelance\"\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n1\n@r1 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n2\",agreement\n11,add one more calendar for me,\"@c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"\"add\"\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"one\"\" dependent=\"\"more\"\" head=\"\"calendar\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"\"for\"\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"\"me\"\"\",agreement\n12,I need a calendar for running,\"@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"\"I\"\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"\"need\"\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"a\"\" head=\"\"calendar\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"\"for\"\" from=$n2 to=$c2\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"\"running\"\"\",agreement\n13,add a teal calendar called Book club,\"@c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"\"add\"\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"a\"\" dependent=\"\"teal\"\" head=\"\"calendar\"\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"\"called\"\" complement=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"Book\"\" head=\"\"club\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$c2\",agreement\n14,create a calendar named Holidays and make it orange,\"@c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"\"create\"\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"a\"\" head=\"\"calendar\"\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"\"named\"\" complement=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"\"Holidays\"\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"\"and\"\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c3\n@c3 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"\"make\"\" modifier=\"\"orange\"\" complement=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"\"it\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$c2\",agreement\n15,please make a purple calendar for Choir,\"@c1 syntax.clause form=imperative discourse=\"\"please\"\" verb=\"\"make\"\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"a\"\" dependent=\"\"purple\"\" head=\"\"calendar\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"\"for\"\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"\"Choir\"\"\",agreement\n16,set up a Birthdays calendar in pink,\"@c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"\"set\"\" modifier=\"\"up\"\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"a\"\" dependent=\"\"Birthdays\"\" head=\"\"calendar\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"\"in\"\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"\"pink\"\"\",agreement\n17,could you add a calendar called Garden with a lime green colour?,\"@c1 syntax.clause form=interrogative auxiliary=\"\"could\"\" verb=\"\"add\"\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"\"you\"\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"a\"\" head=\"\"calendar\"\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"\"called\"\" complement=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"\"Garden\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"\"with\"\" from=$n3 to=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"a\"\" dependent=\"\"lime\"\" dependent=\"\"green\"\" head=\"\"colour\"\"\n@r2 syntax.relation from=$n2 to=$c2\",agreement\n19,make a calendar for Doctor visits and give it a red colour,\"@c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"\"make\"\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"a\"\" head=\"\"calendar\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"\"for\"\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"Doctor\"\" head=\"\"visits\"\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"\"and\"\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n@c2 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"\"give\"\" complement=$n3 com