ault\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"\"in\"\" from=$c1 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"the\"\" head=\"\"basement\"\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"\"and\"\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c3\n@c3 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"\"give\"\" complement=$n4 complement=$n5\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"\"it\"\"\n@n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"6\"\" head=\"\"seats\"\"\n@r2 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$c2\",agreement\n165,there's a new focus room on the mezzanine. Could you add it as Perch?,\"@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"\"there\"\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"\"'s\"\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"a\"\" dependent=\"\"new\"\" dependent=\"\"focus\"\" head=\"\"room\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"\"on\"\" from=$n2 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"the\"\" head=\"\"mezzanine\"\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=interrogative auxiliary=\"\"Could\"\" verb=\"\"add\"\" subject=$n4 complement=$n5\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"\"you\"\"\n@n5 syntax.nominal head=\"\"it\"\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"\"as\"\" from=$c2 to=$n6\n@n6 syntax.nominal head=\"\"Perch\"\"\",agreement\n166,\"if possible, add the Rooftop room - it's on the top floor, above the canteen\",\"@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"\"if\"\" from=$c2 to=$c1\n@c1 syntax.clause form=fragment modifier=\"\"possible\"\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"\"add\"\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"the\"\" dependent=\"\"Rooftop\"\" head=\"\"room\"\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"\"it\"\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"\"'s\"\" subject=$n2\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"\"on\"\" from=$c3 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"the\"\" dependent=\"\"top\"\" head=\"\"floor\"\"\n@r3 syntax.relation marker=\"\"above\"\" from=$c3 to=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"the\"\" head=\"\"canteen\"\"\n@r4 syntax.relation from=$c2 to=$c3\",agreement\n169,new room in the west wing,\"@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"new\"\" head=\"\"r